  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with the boiling water. <br>• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until tender, 12 mins. Drain.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d8421968ee73d4d3ff91a1/step-c966c000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. Thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons. Thinly slice onion (see ingredients). Drain and rinse lentils. <br>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. When oil is hot, cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side.Transfer to a paper towel lined plate.  <br>• Return frying pan to high high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.<br>• Cook carrot, zucchini and onion, until tender, 4-5 mins. <br>• Add tomato paste, Mumbai spice blend, mild North Indian spice blend and drained lentils. Cook, until fragrant, 1-2 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d8421968ee73d4d3ff91a1/step-b1715110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Reduce heat to medium, then add light cooking cream, the water, brown sugar and salt. <br>• Stir to combine and simmer, until lentils are softened and curry is slightly thickened, 5-7 mins. Season to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d8421968ee73d4d3ff91a1/step-499e5520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide rice and creamy Indian lentil, haloumi and veggie curry between bowls. <br>• Top with flaked almonds to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d8421968ee73d4d3ff91a1/step-840f7230.jpg"
    }
  ]
